   }
  },
  "diagnostic_after_freezing": {
   "explicit_mechanism": "Re-run the prompt condition for 100 US respondents per condition with one sentence added to the context that names the mechanism (\"This made the respondent think about whether headlines are accurate.\"). If the model's prompt effect then appears, it can represent the effect but does not infer it from what participants read; if it still does not, sharing predictions do not respond to this kind of manipulation at all."
  }
 },
